        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ad9ec8e4-e3a0-51ac-a48b-64226cf883a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saw II: Flesh & Blood, Saw 3D, Saw IV\n- People: Kevin Greutert, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan, Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, Cary Elwes, Gabby West, Scott Patterson, Lyriq Bent\n- Events: release of Saw 3D, Scream Queens competition\n- Topics: film casts, game tie-in release timing\n\nFacts:\n- Saw II: Flesh & Blood was released in 2010 to coincide with the release of Saw 3D one week later.\n- Saw 3D is a 2010 American 3D horror film.\n- Saw 3D was directed by Kevin Greutert.\n- Saw 3D was written by Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan.\n- Saw 3D is also known as Saw: The Final Chapter and Saw VII.\n- Saw 3D stars Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, and Cary Elwes.\n- Gabby West won a role in Saw 3D through a competition on the reality show Scream Queens.\n- Saw IV stars Tobin Bell, Scott Patterson, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, and Lyriq Bent.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "3856518e-043c-54a4-9df0-09fefdff777b",
        "text": "Page: Saw II: Flesh &amp; Blood. Sentence: It was released in 2010 to coincide with the release of the seventh film, \"Saw 3D\", a week later.\nPage: Saw 3D. Sentence: Saw 3D (also known as Saw: The Final Chapter, or simply Saw VII) is a 2010 American 3D horror film directed by Kevin Greutert, written by Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan, and starring Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery and Cary Elwes.\nPage: Gabby West. Sentence: She won a role in \"Saw 3D\" in a competition on the reality show \"Scream Queens\".\nPage: Saw IV. Sentence: It stars Tobin Bell, Scott Patterson, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, and Lyriq Bent.",
